{"overview":"داستان لوکاس هود، یک دزد حرفه ای رو روایت میکنه که موفق میشه خودش رو به جای کلانتر جدید اما به قتل رسیده شهر بانشی در ایالت پنسیلوانیا جا بزنه و هویتش رو مخفی نگه داره. اون تغییراتی در قانون ایجاد میکنه که بتونه همچنان به کار های خلافش ادامه بده. اما اگر هویت اصلی لوکاس هود فاش بشه چه اتفاقی میفته؟ یا اگر کار هایی که قبلا کرده، این بار در بانشی گریبانگیرش بشه…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Banshee is an American drama television series set in a small town in Pennsylvania Amish country and features an enigmatic ex-con posing as a murdered sheriff who imposes his own brand of justice while also cooking up plans that serve his own interests.","tagline_en":"Small town. Big secrets.","runtime":50,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/zMuJV3k4rYm7keUTu8nhOJOgCSn.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2014,"poster":"/xO668zHo4l7xgBIuK09yujxJ9Kp.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2015,"poster":"/6wytT2aqhf5unVcMMyUfiK6NgMk.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":8,"y":2016,"poster":"/6c2qGkfRkzAYwSKRxlqrNNPz8LY.jpg"}],"episodes":38,"crew":["David Schickler","جاناتان تروپر"],"crew_en":["David Schickler","Jonathan Tropper"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"آنتونی استار","role":"Lucas Hood","photo":"/xx3As5SWcE8vYOKZgtjDjqmT3jc.jpg","en":"Antony Starr"},{"name":"ایوانا ملیسویک","role":"Anastasia / Carrie Hopewell","photo":"/3bWPeAnqRwuCAoYBDig3E3cFx5m.jpg","en":"Ivana Miličević"},{"name":"هون لی","role":"Job","photo":"/bpeejclOnQVYzmxSmrO6rt9oJT4.jpg","en":"Hoon Lee"},{"name":"فرانکی فیزن","role":"Sugar Bates","photo":"/3717JOXK2Z8qelfyvScDGimfFBf.jpg","en":"Frankie Faison"},{"name":"Ulrich Thomsen","role":"Kai Proctor","photo":"/qjXAPbuO8CicunlQs07c1fbFG67.jpg"},{"name":"Matthew Rauch","role":"Clay Burton","photo":"/y2SAw8H4qZGU5cOjazg5LeybiKr.jpg"},{"name":"Matt Servitto","role":"Deputy Brock Lotus","photo":"/3wxehP1Dp81D1pXSk8riU2oCLkG.jpg"},{"name":"Lili Simmons","role":"Rebecca Bowman","photo":"/h1X7C95cwYoDX45Fe4Zk6Kz